  "prefLabel": "He-C 6918.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6918.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to identify the requirements to bill the department of health and human services (DHHS) and receive payment for child care services through a child care scholarship.\n\nSource. #12224, eff 7-10-17; ss by #13066, eff 7-1-20",
